'''Rider''' (ライダー) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rider
|image = E 371.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
She may sport low health and attack power but she has 100% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] your cats at a decent range allowing other enemies to push their way to your attackers.

==Strategy==
Rider is a pretty strong support in the stages she appears in. The best way to counter her is to use freeze immune units, but another way is if you use a rusher to get to her during her downtime and kill her before she freezes them.

